{"date":"2025-09-11","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_a51c31dadbed56481b00d53b160ee237","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1757583000,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-09-08","chunk":0,"id":"m_ec484fb640e222681040f12366b32c48"}}},{"id":"m_c52f3ee99b82cca98be1e1eb4f72f450","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1757583037,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_44c7b0423242a450abfaec8f8178a131","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1757583074,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1bb79b13afc3f4a209de5b07e6093193","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1757583111,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2b7c5fff3e274fbe6fa545fbeefd3ce4","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1757583148,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_382ddce36152cfa6177723f77d242e2a","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1757583185,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ffbcd3562a72a0a7b270123043c8f832","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1757583222,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_61ce70704560023fa786132b61c9b708","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1757583259,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_73a77e3eb51cdf056b53b62f57f22c61","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1757583296,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1dd90f865498e702a2cfc60294945cc9","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1757583333,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e231eb7fca94e6b57e9d1f7297b314ec","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1757583370,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_1cdce9259a80f971ddad3f839e416cb4","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1757583407,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b896ca6748ef8b6759fb39e73956bbc1","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1757583444,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4c75c4ab4761a7bd106c1dea7db5538d","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1757583481,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4003053448d97f021cba12df88ed3fa7","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1757583518,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0e364fcc1928f80826746b034cb4c9a8","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1757583555,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_5aaac7418c95365761c97a828d3e5311","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1757583592,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_003d7a535ea0986d8b902624ac3bd019","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1757583629,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9c7256fd6dfa1d8edb68e3c4cbff9e58","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1757583666,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_48af5f967983b0ebc8d6a91810d28e9c","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1757583703,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5330ae6236e0f7f1064ff436c5a5a384","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1757583740,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_df9a7cdfa3969b777134ea29349cf65c","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1757583777,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f4322310581016c3d38d1c4b17769f25","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1757583814,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1113ebc676cd1a120a286c42bcb24c49","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1757583851,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
